OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister says he will bring
OL,8,Ftogether the first ministers of Wales,
OL,9,FScotland and Northern Ireland in the
OL,10,Fautumn for a summit.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham made the announcement
OL,13,Fahead of a visit to south Wales on
OL,14,FThursday - his first official visit to
OL,15,Fthe country since he took control of
OL,16,Fthe UK government.
OL,18,FThe Labour leader said he wanted "every
OL,19,Fleader in this country signed up" to
OL,20,Fhaving "good jobs in every community".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
